README_simulation file for OxInsIPS Support Module
--------------------------------------------------

How to run the test simulation, the test ioc and the tests all in one go.

./etc/test/OxInstIPS_test.py -t simulation -i -e -g

Do this from the module top directory after you have built it and also
built the generated ioc directory.  

12/01/2018: Above is not working.  Dont think development of the
simulation was completed and there is no example IOC and no
documentation.

The test development was started during development of the module at a
time when the policy was supposed to be the testing simulation was
written before the actual code during the early days of the
development of the python ioc builder.  However there was insufficient
time before the module had to be delivered, so it was never completed
and no example IOC was tested either.  Be extremely sceptical about
any python code, the builder went through rapid evolution, so code in
this module is out-of-date.

BL10J Magnet End Station is probably the only example of this power
module in use at DLS, so the simulation is unlikely to be required.

